{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n昨晚播出的TVB節目《璀璨之城》第九集劇情迎來驚天反轉，官家兄弟內鬥戲碼愈演愈烈，張智霖與吳卓羲的權力鬥爭更趨白熱化！正當觀眾以為張智霖奸計得逞之際，劇情卻揭示一直看似慈父的姜大衞竟是玩弄一切的幕後黑手，讓兩兄弟瞬間淪為棋子，場面極度震撼！\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖「明幫暗害」吳卓羲 兄弟反目成仇</h2>\n<p>劇情講述秉麟（李成昌飾）推出「金鑽會員制」與LKS抗衡，引發家族危機。為了幫助弟弟孝君（吳卓羲飾）通過星級制度躋身董事局，孝賢（張智霖飾）表面上四處奔走，甚至借助妹夫湯俊宇（周志康飾）兄長湯信義（蔡一智飾）的勢力，又親自出面遊說秉麟。然而，他所有行動的最終目的，卻是引發LKS諮詢會的混亂，讓孝君陷入更深的困境。這種「明幫暗害」的陰險計謀，讓兄弟關係徹底決裂。</p>\n<h2>姜大衞突任總監 兩子驚覺被父玩弄</h2>\n<p>正當孝賢以為自己已成功反將孝君一軍，即將坐收漁人之利時，LKS官方卻突然宣布一項驚人任命：官志琛（姜大衞飾）將擔任LKS首席區域總監。這個從天而降的消息，讓鬥得你死我活的孝賢與孝君兩兄弟當場愣住，他們這才恍然大悟，原來自己的一舉一動，全在父親的計算之內，兩人從頭到尾都只是父親權力遊戲中的棋子，被玩弄於股掌之中。</p>\n<h2>官家三父子關係破裂 豪門鬥爭白熱化</h2>\n<p>在得知真相後，官家三父子的關係瞬間陷入冰點。孝賢與孝君意識到，他們最信任的父親，才是這場權力鬥爭中城府最深、手段最狠的玩家。這次的事件徹底撕破了家族和睦的假象，父子之間、兄弟之間的信任蕩然無存。隨著官志琛的正式掌權，可以預見官家的豪門鬥爭將會進入更殘酷的白熱化階段，三父子之間的角力勢必更加精彩。</p>\n<h2>網民睇到咬牙切齒：姜大衞先係終極大佬！</h2>\n<p>這集的高能反轉讓觀眾看得目瞪口呆，網上討論區瞬間被刷屏。網民紛紛表示：「嘩！呢集真係高潮迭起！估唔到最後贏家係老豆！」、「張智霖個角色奸到出汁，但原來老豆更心寒！」、「吳卓羲好慘，成日俾人蝦，今次仲要俾阿哥同老豆一齊夾擊。」、「呢啲先係豪門鬥爭劇，父子兄弟都冇情講，好刺激！」、「睇到手心出汗！期待下集三父子點樣攤牌！」</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_6940609566adaf352b9902.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/25_6940609566adaf352b9902.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_9308070036adaf356206c3.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/26_9308070036adaf356206c3.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_241623406adaf35914837.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/27_241623406adaf35914837.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_14961117586adaf35c614bd.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_14961117586adaf35c614bd.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_8328173026adaf360418cc.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_8328173026adaf360418cc.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_7070856226adaf367030e1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_7070856226adaf367030e1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_244308786adaf36a49012.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_244308786adaf36a49012.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_16752244916adaf3700a235.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_16752244916adaf3700a235.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_12711760336adaf372e0c23.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/35_12711760336adaf372e0c23.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_7144816936adaf3759fb65.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/36_7144816936adaf3759fb65.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_19491610946adaf378492b2.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"0\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/37_19491610946adaf378492b2.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-23T09:23:48.932701+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1178,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-23T09:00:12+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-23T09:39:02.340212+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-23T09:18:17.024378+00:00","content_hash":"27199e1dec889a67c9cb436bc1cb73a161cb34bbfff9522c329a2a4f955d8a5c","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}